{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他不再反复盘算该收住还是放开，仿佛选对了就能不受伤。\",\n      \"key\": \"不再盘算\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他想让对方按自己的心意靠近，不愿为了缓解难受就把期待全压给对方，催他回应。\",\n      \"key\": \"按自己的心意\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-3\",\n      \"text\": \"小心靠近、不求确认地付出、独自珍藏、尽情欢喜都曾让他真切地快乐。它们没替他等来答案，却一次次让他愿意继续靠近，也让他舍不得放下这个人。\",\n      \"key\": \"真切地快乐\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-4\",\n      \"text\": \"以后若等不到对方主动靠近，他仍会疼，却不会因此认定先前的喜欢是假的。\",\n      \"key\": \"仍会疼\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S14-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他仍想被这个人选择，也愿继续喜欢、尽情享受欢喜。他只是在心里不再因怕改变关系就把它收回，也不靠克制证明自己清醒。\",\n      \"key\": \"不再收回\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B4\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S08-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S14-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R65\", \"R68\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S14-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"把两条关于不存在无风险爱法的重复意思收成停止反复盘算，并由两种办法各有局限的亲身经历支撑。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R66\", \"R67\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S14-2\", \"S14-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"压缩\",\n      \"why\": \"保留仍想被选择和让对方按自己的心意靠近，去掉通用道理式的边界说明。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R69\", \"R70\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S14-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"保留四种亲近方式带来的真实快乐，以及这些经历让他舍不得放下这个人的作用，不再另作抽象总结。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R71\", \"R72\", \"R73\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S14-4\", \"S14-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"保留未来可能疼、仍想被选择、仍愿继续喜欢；把最终选择写成心里不再收回，不补写已经向对方说出口的情境。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "499bedbe-b640-40c9-ab92-ca1c6b9d8f5e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T224711914554Z", "elapsed_seconds": 211.609, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T22:50:43.537376+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1fdfb6b3a47fec129e3528ec88315c3a2906f78d7c54adb0469dc0a5ef37dcf5", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.p